#==============================================================================================
#
#   formatting_context_5 - Layout::FormattingContext: intrinsic sizes, inner sizes and the
#                          auto-ness of sizes
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/FormattingContext.cpp (lines 1872-2330): fit-content sizes,
#       min-/max-content widths and heights (laid out in a throwaway LayoutState and cached on
#       the box), inner widths and heights (box-sizing, the percentage height quirk), the
#       containing block width a node resolves against, stretch-fit sizes, when a width or
#       height is treated as auto, and whitespace-only anonymous boxes.
